  "decision_rule": "PLAN W6.3: the default changes only if a paired gbrain-evals record at 1024 and 1536 dimensions with real embeddings and two filter selectivities shows no latency regression beyond noise; otherwise the item leaves the wave",
  "verdict": "ships default-on",
  "decision": "relaxed_order is gbrain's default for filtered pgvector iterative scans. Recall at the 50% filter rises 2.1 points (1024-d) and 1.7 points (1536-d) at k=10 and is never lower. In single runs, latency moves in both directions: the largest rises are +5.7% at p50 and +7.0% at p95, the largest fall is -7.9% at p95, and no lane-filter-k cell rises at both p50 and p95 by more than 1 ms. search.hnsw_iterative_scan strict_order (or GBRAIN_HNSW_ITERATIVE_SCAN) restores the old mode after a restart."
